he space is not good\",\n        \"hi\": \"The overall impression of the space is good\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"trials\": [\n       {\n        \"id\": \"space01\",\n        \"label\": \"Space 1\",\n        \"image\": \"space01.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"space02\",\n        \"label\": \"Space 2\",\n        \"image\": \"space02.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"space03\",\n        \"label\": \"Space 3\",\n        \"image\": \"space03.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"space04\",\n        \"label\": \"Space 4\",\n        \"image\": \"space04.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"space05\",\n        \"label\": \"Space 5\",\n        \"image\": \"space05.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"space06\",\n        \"label\": \"Space 6\",\n        \"image\": \"space06.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"space07\",\n        \"label\": \"Space 7\",\n        \"image\": \"space07.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"space08\",\n        \"label\": \"Space 8\",\n        \"image\": \"space08.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"space09\",\n        \"label\": \"Space 9\",\n        \"image\": \"space09.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"space10\",\n        \"label\": \"Space 10\",\n        \"image\": \"space10.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"space11\",\n        \"label\": \"Space 11\",\n        \"image\": \"space11.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"space12\",\n        \"label\": \"Space 12\",\n        \"image\": \"space12.jpg\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#eceee8;--card:#fff;--ink:#22261f;--muted:#5f675a;--accent:#8a3324;--accent-ink:#fff;--line:#d9ddd2;--warn:#b3261e;--miss:#fdecea}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 10px}\np{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n.q{margin-top:18px}.q>b{display:block;margin-bottom:4px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--card)}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}\n.t{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}\n.bar{height:5px;background:var(--line);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;flex:1;margin-left:12px;max-width:260px}.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}\n.pic{background:#e3e6df;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.pic img{width:100%;max-height:min(50vh,460px);object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.it{padding:10px 6px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}\n.it .x{font-weight:500;margin-bottom:6px}\n.sc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:2px}.sub{margin:16px 0 4px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)}.desc{color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 10px}input.tx{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:240px}\n.sc label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;padding:2px 0}\n.sc input{width:20px;height:20px;margin:0 0 2px}\n.ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}\n.it.miss{background:var(--miss)}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photographs: Ding, Wei, Jin, Nie, Zhang, Zhou &amp; Ma (2023), Sustainability 15:2790, Figure 2, doi:10.3390/su15032790 (CC BY 4.0; Sanhe Ancient Town, Hefei, China). Map connector lines retouched out. Used with credit for research; removed if the authors object.</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='sanhe2023:';\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, ans={}, TR=[], ITEMS=[], done={};\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e){e.textContent=m||'';e.style.visibility='visible';}}\n  function hideErr(){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.style.visibility='hidden';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function load(k){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY+k));}catch(e){return null;}}\n  function save(k,v){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY+k,JSON.stringify(v));}catch(e){}}\n  function q(n){return Q[n]||{};}\n  function page(html,btn,cb){app.innerHTML=html+'<div style=\"margin-top:18px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+esc(btn)+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';document.getElementById('go').onclick=cb;\n    app.onchange=function(e){hideErr();var r=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('.it');if(r)r.classList.remove('miss');};}\n  function send(list,b,fin){b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}fin();});}\n  function lab(v){return v>0?'+'+v:(v<0?'−'+(-v):'0');}\n  function row(it){return '<div class=\"it\" data-k=\"'+it.key+'\"><div class=\"ends\" style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--ink)\"><span style=\"text-align:left;max-width:48%\">'+esc(it.lo)+'</span><span style=\"text-align:right;max-width:48%\">'+esc(it.hi)+'</span></div><div class=\"sc\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"'+esc(it.lo+' to '+it.hi)+'\">'+[-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+it.key+'\" value=\"'+v+'\">'+lab(v)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div></div>';}\n  function radios(n){var d=q(n);return '<div class=\"q it\" data-k=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+esc(d.title)+'</b>'+(d.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function picked(names){var L=[],miss=[];names.forEach(function(n){var r=app.querySelector('.it[data-k=\"'+n+'\"]'),c=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');if(!c){miss.push(r);r.classList.add('miss');}else L.push([n,Number(c.value)]);});\n    if(miss.length){err('Please answer the questions marked in red.');miss[0].scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return null;}return L;}\n  function next(){\n    window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    if(!ans.intro)return intro();\n    if(!ans.about)return about();\n    for(var i=0;i<TR.length;i++)if(!done[TR[i].id])return scene(TR[i],i);\n    finish();\n  }\n  function intro(){\n    if(TR.some(function(t){return !files[t.image];})){app.innerHTML='<h1>Pictures missing</h1><p>Media folder spaces must hold the twelve photographs space01.jpg … space12.jpg.</p>';return;}\n    page('<h1>Public spaces of Sanhe Ancient Town</h1><p>This survey is about the public spaces of the historical and cultural block of Sanhe Ancient Town in Hefei, China. You will see 12 photographs and judge each space on 17 pairs of opposite words.</p><p>It takes about 15 minutes. Your answers are anonymous and used only for research.</p><div class=\"card\">'+radios('consent')+'</div>','Start',function(){\n      var L=picked(['consent']);if(!L)return;\n      if(L[0][1]!==1){app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you</h1><p>You chose not to take part. You can close this window now.</p>';return;}\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',1)],this,function(){ans.intro=true;save('a',ans);next();});});\n  }\n  function about(){\n    page('<h1>About you</h1><div class=\"card\">'+['gender','age_group','occupation'].map(radios).join('')+'</div>','Continue',function(){\n      var L=picked(['gender','age_group','occupation']);if(!L)return;\n      send(L.map(function(p){return SPSite.answer(p[0],p[1]);}),this,function(){ans.about=true;save('a',ans);next();});});\n  }\n  function scene(t,i){\n    var f=files[t.image];\n    page('<div class=\"top\"><span class=\"t\">Photo '+(i+1)+' of '+TR.length+'</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:'+(100*i/TR.length)+'%\"></i></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"'+esc(t.label)+', public space in Sanhe Ancient Town\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div>'\n      +'<p class=\"desc\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Please carefully watch the image and judge it by your first impression. For each pair of words, −3 means very much the left word, +3 very much the right word, and 0 is in between.</p>'+ITEMS.map(row).join('')+'</div>',i===TR.length-1?'Finish':'Next photo',function(){\n      var v={},miss=[];\n      ITEMS.forEach(function(it){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+it.key+'\"]:checked');var r=app.querySelector('.it[data-k=\"'+it.key+'\"]');if(x){v[it.key]=Number(x.value);r.classList.remove('miss');}else{miss.push(r);r.classList.add('miss');}});\n      if(miss.length){err(miss.length+' pair'+(miss.length>1?'s are':' is')+' not answered yet (marked in red).');miss[0].scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return;}\n      send([SPSite.answer('sd_rating',v,{key:t.id,shown:[f.name]})],this,function(){done[t.id]=true;next();});});\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p>In the original study, 35 design professionals and 35 non-professionals rated these 12 spaces, and 50 people also viewed them with an eye tracker. Building structures, green landscape and architectural decoration drew the most visual attention, and the psychological and visual evaluations were related but did not fully agree.</p><p style=\"font-size:.82rem\">Photographs and method: Ding, W., Wei, Q., Jin, J., Nie, J., Zhang, F., Zhou, X., &amp; Ma, Y. (2023). Research on Public Space Micro-Renewal Strategy of Historical and Cultural Blocks in Sanhe Ancient Town under Perception Quantification. Sustainability 15:2790, doi:10.3390/su15032790.</p><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');var m=r.missing||[];setTimeout(function(){m.forEach(function(x){if(x==='consent')ans.intro=false;else if(x==='sd_rating')done={};else ans.about=false;});save('a',ans);next();},1800);}\n      else{var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers have been saved. You can close this window now.';}});\n  }\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    var SPEC;try{SPEC=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('sp-scheme').textContent).survey;}catch(e){SPEC={pages:[]};}\n    SPEC.pages.forEach(function(p){p.elements.forEach(function(e){var g=SPSite.getQuestion(e.name)||{};Q[e.name]={title:g.title||e.title,choices:(g.choices&&g.choices.length)?g.choices:e.choices};if(e.name==='sd_rating'){TR=e.trials;ITEMS=e.items;}});});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('spaces')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name]=f;});\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};ans=load('a')||{};\n    ((a.sd_rating&&a.sd_rating.trials)||[]).forEach(function(t){if(t.key)done[t.key]=true;});\n    ans.intro=a.consent===1;ans.about=a.occupation!=null;\n    next();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
